{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう7月だと知り驚きました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏らしい事をする予定は無いので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非お誘い待ってます。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも今年はフェスに出演させていただけるので、とっても楽しみです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は今月末から始まるツアーの準備をしています"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6都市12公演！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年より公演数が増えて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみも増えて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張るぞーーの気持ちです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハーサル期間中、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん寂しいかなと思ったので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを書いてみました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆるめのブログ！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆるーーく読んでいってください"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob9nG2mV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobkg0Syn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "帰りが一緒になる事が多いので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よく会話をします"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日も、帰り一緒だった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣似合ってたなーー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobx5SpPw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久々に写真でも撮りますか　となったもふもふさん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "白い浴衣似合うなあ　可愛い"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobgoHxKw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真撮影をする同期"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピンク率高くて可愛い"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob3R6xJE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobM375O8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏鈴さんにちょっかいかけすぎて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美青ちゃんとよく反省する"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏鈴さん真ん中に立っててください！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と言って撮った写真。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これやりましょう！　っていうと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大体の事に付き合ってくださる"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobsPLRM8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯一出来るようになったゲーム"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "三期生全員でやりました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな同じキャラクターにしてたから"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしどれ！ってずっとなってた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobYZyzDb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜか"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スターウォーズのフィギュア　？　が"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "並べられてた"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛季と純葉"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "良い目をしてます"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobTJb3fw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しそうに話す同期と後輩"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛おしいなと思って、つい撮っちゃいました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目黒ちゃん凄い笑ってる"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobFZYQpi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生ライブ　行かせていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あまりにも素敵なライブだったから"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "欲が出ちゃって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "終演後、三期生の控え室で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか11人で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またちゃんとライブがしたいね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "って話になりました"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobaLhjq5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobV0dD0S.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日一緒にBLTさんの表紙を"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮らせていただいた日の写真。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優月ちゃんと一緒の現場は楽しいです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラマ撮影の時も思ったけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に太陽みたいな人"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "空気がパッと明るくなる"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "才能ですねーー…"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobiMdrLd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "チョコ買ってきてってお願いしたら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どっちが良い？　って"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二つ買ってきてくれた日。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しっかりどっちも好みで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "んーーー、2人で半分こしよ　って言いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "終わり！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また写真とエピソードが溜まったら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういうブログ書きますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーまでわくわくまっていてください"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "引き続きリハーサルがんばります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}], "source": "official"}